 ertainment experiences that keep audiences laughing\, amazed\, and thorough
 ly engaged.\n\nFrom showrooms in Las Vegas to Royal Caribbean Cruise Line s
 tages around the world\, John delivers dynamic\, out-of-the-box performance
 s that leave audiences laughing\, amazed\, and coming back for more.\n\nThi
 s stage hypnosis show reimagines a centuries-old art form. Set to modern mu
 sic and infused with pop culture\, it’s fun\, fast-paced\, and packed wit
 h energy\, making it a hit with audiences of all ages. Beyond the laughter 
